 into parts would help. Let's see:\n\n798,307 is 700,000 + 98,000 + 307\n\n509,008 is 500,000 + 9,000 + 8\n\nAdding the hundreds of thousands: 700k +500k =1,200,000\n\nThen 98,000 +9,000 =107,000\n\nThen 307 +8 =315\n\nAdding all together: 1,200,000 +107,000 =1,307,000; plus 315 gives 1,307,315. Okay that matches. So the answer should be 1,307,315. Let me check once more with standard addition:\n\n798307\n+509008\n--------\nStarting from the right:\n\n7+8=15, write 5, carry 1.\n\n0+0+1=1, write 1.\n\n3+0=3, write 3.\n\n8+9=17, write 7, carry 1.\n\n9 (ten-thousands place) +0 +1=10, write 0, carry 1.\n\n7 (hundred thousands) +5 (hundred thousands) =12, plus the carried 1 makes 13. So write 3 in the hundred thousands place and carry 1 to the millions, which becomes 1. So the total is 1,307,315. Yep, that's correct.\n</think>\n\n",
