,000,000 + 74,933 = 1,074,933. \n\nOkay, that matches my previous result. So the sum should be 1,074,933. I think that's correct. Let me just do a quick check using estimation. \n\n920,268 is approximately 920,000 and 154,665 is about 155,000. Adding those gives 1,075,000. The exact answer is 1,074,933, which is 67 less than the estimate. That makes sense because I rounded both numbers up a bit. The first was rounded down by 268 and the second up by 335. The net difference would be 335 - 268 = 67. So the exact answer is indeed 67 less than the estimate. That checks out. \n\nTherefore, I'm confident the answer is correct.\n</think>\n\n",
