3=5\nHundreds:4+4=8\nThousands:6+7=13 (carry 1)\nTen-thousands:6+7+1=14 (carry 1)\nHundred-thousands:4+3+1=8\n\nYes, that seems right. So the sum is indeed 843,859. I think that's correct. Maybe I can check using another method, like rounding?\n\nAlternatively, let's add them as numbers:\n\n466,424 + 377,435.\n\nBreaking it down:\n\n400,000 + 300,000 = 700,000\n\n60,000 + 70,000 = 130,000 \u2192 Total so far: 830,000\n\n6,000 + 7,000 = 13,000 \u2192 843,000\n\n400 + 400 = 800 \u2192 843,800\n\n20 + 30 = 50 \u2192 843,850\n\n4 +5 =9 \u2192 843,859. Yep, matches. Okay, confident now.\n</think>\n\n",
