4,382\n=?\nAdding the ones: 2+2=4. Correct.\nTens: 9+8=17, so 7 with a carryover. Right.\nHundreds: 1+3+1=5. Yes.\nThousands: 9+4=13, so 3 and carryover. Correct.\nTen-thousands: 8+3=11 plus 1 is 12. So 2 with carryover. Yup.\nHundred-thousands: 3+7=10 plus 1 is 11. So 1 and carryover. Then the million. So total is 1,123,574. Looks right. I think that's the correct answer.\n</think>\n\n",
