ands), so 1,704,684. Yeah, that seems right. Let me add them another way to confirm. Maybe break them down:\n\n806,649 + 898,035. Let's split into 800,000 + 6,649 and 800,000 + 98,035. Adding the 800k + 800k = 1,600,000. Then 6,649 + 98,035. 6,649 + 98,000 is 104,649, then plus 35 is 104,684. So total is 1,600,000 + 104,684 = 1,704,684. Yep, matches. Okay, confident now.\n</think>\n\n",
