,000 is 57,000. So total so far is 800k +57k = 857,000.\n\nThen the remaining parts: 993 + 333. Let's see, 993 + 300 is 1,293, plus 33 more is 1,326. So adding that to 857,000 gives 857,000 + 1,326 = 858,326. Okay, that matches my previous result. So I think that's correct. Maybe I should do a column addition again just to be thorough.\n\nLet me write it out vertically again:\n\n\u2003728993\n+129333\n----------\nStarting from the right:\n\nOnes: 3+3=6\n\nTens:9+3=12 (carry 1)\nHundreds:9+3+1=13 (carry 1)\nThousands:8+9+1=18 (carry 1)\nTen-thousands:2+2+1=5\nHundred-thousands:7+1=8\n\nSo the digits are 8 (hundred-thousands), 5 (ten-thousands), 8 (thousands), 3 (hundreds), 2 (tens), 6 (ones). So 858,326. Yep, that's consistent. I think that's the right answer.\n</think>\n\n",
