ds), 4 (hundred thousands). So hundreds place is 5, thousands is 5, ten thousands is 5, etc.\n\nSo when adding hundreds place: 7 +5 =12. That's 2 with carryover 1 to thousands.\n\nThousands place: 1 (from first number) +5 (second) +1 (carry) =7. So that's correct.\n\nTen thousands:4 +5=9.\n\nHundred thousands:2+4=6.\n\nSo the total is 697,274. Wait, but when I broke it down earlier, I thought maybe 600k +90k is 690k, plus 6k (from thousands place?), but actually the thousands place after adding gives 7, so total would be 697,274. Yeah, that seems right. Let me add them numerically:\n\n241,707 + 455,567.\n\n241,707 + 400,000 = 641,707.\n\n641,707 +55,567 = ?\n\n641,707 +50,000 = 691,707.\n\n691,707 +5,567 = 697,274. Yep, that matches. Okay, so the answer should be 697,274.\n</think>\n\n",
